  "description": "*\"Sir, please be my husband for just one night.\"*\n\nBorn into a noble family, Su-Woon is the often-overlooked second son. But he grows into the ideal husband candidate—passing the national exam as the top scholar at age 20. Perfect from head to toe, many women try to approach him, yet Su-Woon has no interest in women or marriage. Until one day… Su-Woon, who had been enjoying a comfortable and elegant life as a refined scholar, is suddenly kidnapped— and loses his virginity to a complete stranger! Now, the abducted Su-Woon sets off in search of the crazy woman who stole his first time…!\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of RIDI's Seonbi Danpyeonseon (선비 단편선) Collection.*",
